---
import Notes from "@pres/components/Notes.astro";
import PhotoCollage from "@pres/components/PhotoCollage.astro";
import landscape from "./assets/photo-landscape.jpg";
import strawberries from "./assets/photo-strawberries.jpg";
import puppy from "./assets/photo-puppy.jpg";
export const meta = {"title":"PhotoCollage · 拍立得相框"};
---

<div style="height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 2.5rem;">
  <div style="width: 300px; transform: rotate(-4deg);">
    <PhotoCollage src={landscape.src} alt="山间河谷" caption="山河" />
  </div>
  <div style="width: 300px; transform: rotate(1.5deg);">
    <PhotoCollage src={strawberries.src} alt="新鲜草莓" caption="草莓" />
  </div>
  <div style="width: 300px; transform: rotate(5deg);">
    <PhotoCollage src={puppy.src} alt="拉布拉多幼犬" caption="幼犬" />
  </div>
</div>

<Notes>

PhotoCollage：白边拍立得相框，图片 + 底部手写体说明。共识类资产图鉴那一页就是它扇形铺开的效果，这里是最朴素的三张并排。

</Notes>
